## Why This Is Asked
This evaluates expertise in deploying real-time ML systems within AWS for privacy-sensitive, multi-tenant environments requiring comprehensive monitoring, explainability, and rapid recovery capabilities.

## Key Concepts
- AWS PrivateLink and SageMaker endpoint architecture
- Private data lake integration with strict multi-tenant isolation
- Real-time drift detection and SHAP/IG explainability frameworks
- Provisioned concurrency and autoscaling for performance targets

## Code Example
```javascript
// Explainer integration for inference transparency
function explainInference(model, input, featureNames) {
  const shapValues = model.predictSHAP(input);
  const igValues = model.predictIntegratedGradients(input);
  return {
    prediction: model.predict(input),
    explanations: {
      shap: shapValues,
      integratedGradients: igValues,
      featureNames: featureNames
    },
    timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),
    tenantId: extractTenantId(input)
  };
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical deployment choices that balance latency, cost, and data locality for beginners.

## Key Concepts
- SageMaker Endpoint configuration and quantization
- Auto-scaling by latency target
- Canary rollouts for low-risk deployment
- Data residency and basic validation

## Code Example
```javascript
// setup autoscaling (simplified)
import { ApplicationAutoScalingClient, RegisterScalableTargetCommand, PutScalingPolicyCommand } from '@aws-sdk/client-application-auto-scaling';
const c = new ApplicationAutoScalingClient({region: 'us-east-1'});
async function cfg(){
  await c.send(new RegisterScalableTarget({
    ServiceNamespace: 'sagemaker',
    ResourceId: 'endpoint/my-image-endpoint/variant/AllTraffic',
    ScalableDimension: 'sagemaker:variant:DesiredInstanceCount',
    MinCapacity: 1,
    MaxCapacity: 20
  }));
  await c.send(new PutScalingPolicy({
    PolicyName: 'LatencyTarget',
    PolicyType: 'TargetTrackingScaling',
    ServiceNamespace: 'sagemaker',
    ResourceId: 'endpoint/my-image-endpoint/variant/AllTraffic',
    ScalableDimension: 'sagemaker:variant:DesiredInstanceCount',
    TargetTrackingScalingPolicyConfiguration: {
      TargetValue: 200
    }
  }));
}
```

